  "notes": {
    "cards-note": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "The 13 cards from the design system\n\nMobile: Card-160, Card-320, Card-Image-Text. Tablet to desktop: Card-480 to Card-1920 (photo fills the card; wide cards put the words in a see-through panel).\n\nFilled with the original sample (CPO→CIO). Each element's data-spot is its content field: ct100, ct200, ct300, cs, cb, tags, cp, cpdt, image (CI-01).\n\nSame as the cards on /design-system (components/Card.tsx).",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 2680,
      "y": 18080
    },
    "foot-note": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "Footer: same on every page\n\nDesktop: two rows split by a white hairline, with a back-to-top button. Tablet and phone: one column, no back-to-top.",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 2680,
      "y": 16220
    },
    "hero-full": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "Full screen on desktop and tablet\n\nThe hero always fills the browser window's height (or more, if the words need it). These boards show a 1280 x 800 laptop and a 768 x 1024 tablet. Phone keeps its own height.",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 2680,
      "y": 1100
    },
    "howto": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 720,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "How this canvas works\n\n1. One row per Studio template, at Desktop 1280 · Tablet 768 · Phone 390.\n\n2. Change anything. Keep the board names and the spot names (shown in each element's data-spot) so Claude can match your changes back to Studio.\n\n3. Colors and type: use the ClearMark values. Anything off-system is snapped to the nearest ClearMark color, text style or 32px step on the way back, and listed for you.\n\n4. Check it: type /push-check logos in Claude (or comment \"push check logos\" on its row and send it to Claude). Claude brings it into the Studio prototype, tests it and shows you. Nothing goes live.\n\n5. Put it live: when you're happy, type /push-live (or comment \"push live\" and send it to Claude). It's on clearmark.bz in about 2 minutes.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 0
    },
    "nav-note": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "Global nav: same on every page\n\nShown on its Midnight bar (pages that start without a photo). Over a photo (Home) the bar is see-through: see the Hero boards.\n\nTablet and phone: logo and a menu button. Press Play on those boards and click it: the lines turn into an X and the menu slides open over the page (About, Solutions, Platforms, Pricing, Book a call). Click the X to close it. The light area under the bar stands in for the page.",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 2680,
      "y": 15240
    },
    "offer-cards-note": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "Offer card templates, built from the design-system cards\n\nFull: Card-1280 on desktop (grows to Card-1920 on wider screens), Card-640 on tablet, Card-320 on phone.\nTwo: Card-640 ×2 · Card-320 ×2 · Card-160 ×2.\nThree: Card-320 ×3 · Card-160 ×3 · Card-320 ×3 stacked on phone.\n\nFilled with the real offers. Fields: ct100 title, ct200 subtitle, cp price, cpdt price note, tags, image (CI-01).",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 2680,
      "y": 9000
    },
